<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="363fb5b6">&lt;p&gt;
    Select a platform, stakeholders, trainers and schedule for training.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Decide upon delivery channel and technology to be used.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop the Training Logistics Tracker and populate as appropriate to capture the approach to preparing all
        training logistics including finding and securing venue/s, inviting attendees and ordering IT equipment and
        materials for training
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review the checklist worksheets in the tracker (the dark blue tabs) and review the key activities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communicate with the Trainers and agree their responsibilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Agree owners to manage the various logistics
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Share tracker with owners and agree responsibilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    When planning logistics to deliver training,&amp;nbsp;take into account&amp;nbsp;the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        IT or A/V needs
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Space is needed for this particular training
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Space is needed to accommodate all participants
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Need to arrange for lodging accommodations
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Participants have food allergies
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Communicate training session details and track participant enrollment.&amp;nbsp; Continue communications as necessary to
    maximize enrollment.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
