<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="ea0ddc80">&lt;p&gt;
    To maximize the efficiency and&amp;nbsp;productivity of the learning experience for impacted stakeholders by planning and
    communicating to learners the &apos;where&apos; and &apos;when&apos; of training activities.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
